### Intellij+all Patch ###
# Ignores the whole .idea folder and all .iml files
# See https://github.com/joeblau/gitignore.io/issues/186 and https://github.com/joeblau/gitignore.io/issues/360

.idea/

# Reason: https://github.com/joeblau/gitignore.io/issues/186#issuecomment-249601023

*.iml
modules.xml
.idea/misc.xml
*.ipr

# Sonarlint plugin
.idea/sonarlint

### Java ###
# Compiled class file
*.class

# Log file
*.log

# BlueJ files
*.ctxt

# Mobile Tools for Java (J2ME)
.mtj.tmp/

# Package Files #
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# Exceptions to *.jar — a clean checkout cannot build without these two: the Gradle wrapper
# itself, and the compile-only L2Tabs API stub resolved via flatDir('libs') (dev.xkmc.l2tabs
# has no public Maven coordinate).
#
# Legendary Tabs used to need a third exception here, and that is precisely how the 1.9.0
# clean-build defect happened: build.gradle was moved to the 2.0 API, the 1.x jar exception
# was left in place, and the 2.0 jar it actually needed stayed ignored — so nobody but the
# author could build the repo (RS10-001). It now compiles against an in-repo source stub
# (src/legendarytabsApi/java) and needs no jar. Do NOT add a new jar exception here without
# also proving the fresh-clone-build CI job passes.
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!libs/l2tabs-0.3.3.jar

# virtual machine crash logs, see http://www.java.com/en/download/help/error_hotspot.xml
hs_err_pid*

