# A full clone of this repository was once left at ./runic-skills/ -- untracked, unignored, 9.8 MB,
# with its own .git and a VERSION four releases behind. Every local grep returned doubled hits and
# every search result had to be checked for which copy it came from. Ignore the path so a stray
# `git clone` inside the working tree cannot quietly repeat it.
/runic-skills/
